{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-23T20:44:22.714Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of the work:\n\n**New shared modules**\n- `src/core/spec/verify-paths.ts` — moved `tokenizeVerifyCommand` and the named-path operand rules out of `linter.ts`; exports the tokenizer, `listNamedPaths` (operands that are not options/absolute/assignments/URLs/bare first tokens and contain a separator), and `missingNamedPaths` (exact operands by existence, glob operands via `resolveScope`).\n- `src/core/spec/verify-starts.ts` — `analyzeVerifyStarts` walks tasks in numeric order and returns contradictions and uncreatable paths; a glob operand is covered only by an identical scope entry.\n\n**Changed**\n- `src/core/run/scope.ts` gained `scopeCoversPath`, a pure exact/glob coverage predicate reusing `globToRegExp`.\n- `src/core/spec/linter.ts` now imports the shared rules, collects each task's parse/scope, then runs one ordered pass after the loop: suppresses the unresolved-target warning when every missing named path is scope-covered, and emits the contradiction and uncreatable warnings. It is now 1,094 lines (below the 1,108 baseline).\n\n**Tests**\n- `tests/verify-paths.test.ts` (quoted operands, `--import tsx`, assignments, URLs, bare first/pathless tokens, path-shaped first token, unmatched glob).\n- `tests/lint-verify-starts.test.ts` (066-shaped `any`/`green` contradiction, `red` clean, earlier-scope coverage, uncreatable, no unresolved warning for a task's own new test).\n\nBoth the task verify (`15/15`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) pass, and preexisting `tests/linter.test.ts` stays green (`53/53`). Result written to `.run/results/1.md`."}}
